1- Assign order to on duty courier (system) Jerome
ID:
UC-DRV-01
Title:
Assign order to on duty courier
Description:
When an order is marked as ready the system should assign the delivery request to available couriers based off the following rule:
shortest straight line distance from courier to restaurant smallest courier id is the tie breaker.
Primary Actor:
System
Preconditions:
Order is marked as ready
One or more couriers are Idle
Postconditions:
Delivery request is sent to the closest, in terms of straight line distance, courier which he can then accept or decline
Inputs:
Restaurant location
All available courier locations
Order information, including destination location
Outputs:
Delivery request sent to courier
Main Success Scenario:
An order is marked as ready
The system fetches all location (longitude and latitude) of all available couriers
The system calculates all straight line distance from all couriers to the restaurant
The system sends a delivery request to the closest courier, using the smallest courier id as a tie breaker.







