ID:
UC-PRC-05
Title:
Send Refund Order Request
Description:
In the case where a customer is dissatisfied with their order or didn’t receive their orders, the customer can issue a refund request, which will be reviewed and then approved or declined by the system operator, for undelivered orders and delivered orders.
Primary Actor:
Customer
Preconditions:
Customer is logged in
Customer issued an order
Order has been delivered less than 1.5 hours ago or Courier has either lost or not delivered the order
Postconditions:
Order refund request is issued to system operator
Inputs:
Order Information
Reason for refund
Proof to back refund case
Outputs:
Refund request
Main Success Scenario:
The customer orders an order
The courier is assigned the order
The courier either loses the order or the customer is not satisfied with the order quality
The customer issues a refund request highlighting the reason for the refund and proof for his case












6- Accept Refund Order Request (Operator) Jerome

ID:
UC-PRC-06
Title:
Accept Refund Order Request
Description:
In the case where a customer is dissatisfied with their order or didn’t receive their orders, the customer can issue a refund request, which will be reviewed and then approved or declined by the system operator, for undelivered orders and delivered orders.
Primary Actor:
System Operator
Preconditions:
Customer issued a refund request
System Operator is logged in
System Operator received refund request
Postconditions:
Refund Request is approved
Customer is refunded the amount he paid for
The order is marked as refunded in the system
The refund payment is marked in the system
The Restaurant is notified of the refund
Inputs:
Refund Request
Order information, including customer, courier and restaurant and payment amount
Outputs:
Customer is refunded the money
Order is marked as refunded
Billing and ledger are updated
Restaurant is notified of the refund
Main Success Scenario:
The customer issues a refund request
The operator reviews the refund request
After reviewing, the operator believes the refund request as valid and accepts it
The customer is refunded his money
The order is marked as refunded, billing and ledgers are updated and the restaurant is notified of the refund





